<title>UK: Electrocomponents revs up but stg a concern.</title>
<headline>Electrocomponents revs up but stg a concern.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrocomponents Plc said on Friday all of its operations showed revenue increases in the first few months of the financial year, although sterling was a concern.</p>
<p>&quot;It would be wrong not to express some concern at the accelerated rise in sterling and its consequent effect on our UK customers who export,&quot; chairman Roy Cotterill said in a brief statement from the company's annual meeting.</p>
<p>Electrocomponents' shares slipped 1.5p to 433.5 at 1130 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
